    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1847_6857.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser fründtlich willig deinst, unnd waß wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs und guots vermoegend zuovor, From, Fürsichtig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrsamm</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wyß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innsonders</unclear> guot fründt und gethrüw lieb <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName>.
<lb n="4"/>Wir sind hüt dato von unsers gethrüwen mitraths haupt-
<lb n="5"/>man <persName resp="#ner">Niclauß Vogels</persName> saeligen wittwen, Rechtgebnen Vogt,
<lb n="6"/>Unnd <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heidlj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eblj</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">baß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsten</unclear> Erben, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bluots</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwandten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wylandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürgers</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Walthis</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saelig</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear> worden, Welcher maßen inen uß bedencklichen
<lb n="9"/>ursachen, sollich Erbguot noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißhar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allencklichen</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">folgen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syedann</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sye</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermelte</unclear> Erben, har-
<lb n="11"/>umb uff bestimte Jahr gnuogsame Bürgschafft (by deren
<lb n="12"/>in daß künfftig, wann es die notturfft erforderen
<lb n="13"/>wurde, sollich haab unnd guot widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zefinden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear>.)
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darstellend</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haruf</unclear> sy nit ermanglet, zwen ehrliche
<lb n="15"/>herren (lutß eüwr u. g. l. E. jüngst an unß abgang-
<lb n="16"/>nem schryben.) von unseren Räthen zeerbaeten, sich nach
<lb n="17"/>gethanem begeren In diser Bürgschafft uff zwey oder
<lb n="18"/>drü Jahr Inzelaßen. Und die wyl dann unser ge-
<lb n="19"/>thrüwer liebr Mitrath Herr <persName resp="#ner">Adam Boeninger</persName> Lanndtß-
<lb n="20"/>Statthalter, von obgedachter frauw wittib, unnd <persName resp="#ner">Hanß
<lb n="21"/>Bach</persName> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">synr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dochteren</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heidlj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eblis</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollich</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erb</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgehoerter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesin</unclear>, und gnuogsame
<lb n="23"/>quitung zegeben, vor unnß versprochen. Welche wir
<lb n="24"/>harzuo alß habliche und Wachthaffte Persohnen, ohnfähl-
<lb n="25"/>barlich gnuogsam sin erckennend.
<lb n="26"/>Uff solches so habend beid Parthÿen an unß wider-
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angelanngt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vorgedachten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanndtß</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statthalter</unclear> uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittel</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">g</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzeordnen</unclear>, dises Erbs halber, waß inen
<lb n="30"/>noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehoeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechtj</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechenschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeempfahen</unclear>, und
<lb n="31"/>daßelb Inzenemmen, Und ob er sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glychwol</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erstlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweigret</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jedoch</unclear> uff unnser an Ine ge-
<lb n="33"/>thanes fründtliches begeren, hatt er von unsrnt
<lb n="34"/>wegen unnß zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gfallen</unclear>, sich Ingelaßen.
<lb n="35"/>Derowegen gelangt an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">l</unclear>. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidgnoßen</unclear></orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1847_6858.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="36"/>unser freündtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoeßisch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pit</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear>, Ir
<lb n="37"/>wellend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgemelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Landts=vathalter</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>in synem begeren freündtlich an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> be-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürderen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oberkeitliche</unclear> fürsehung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>,
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">damit</unclear> diß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gschefft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> einer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">endtschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebracht</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">parthyen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyteren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kostens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberhept</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, wie wir dann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herinn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwyfflend</unclear>, Ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> ohne daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begirig</unclear> sin
<lb n="44"/>werdend. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear> begerend wir
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jhn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürfallenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glegenheiten</unclear> umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eidt</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnoeßisch</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobeschulden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverdienen</unclear>,
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> wir alle <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoeßische</unclear></orgName> freündtschafft
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobewysen</unclear> wol geneigt sind. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hiemit</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmechtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> wol
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bevelchende</unclear>. Datum den. <origDate when="1613" resp="#ner">16. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Maÿ</unclear> Anno 1613</origDate>.
<lb n="51"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-502" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Landtaman</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Rath.
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Glaruß</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1847_6859.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1847_6860.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="53"/>Den frommen, fuersichtigen, ehr-
<lb n="54"/>sammen unnd wysen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="55"/>meister und Rath der Statt
<lb n="56"/>Sannct Gallen</orgName>, unsern insonders
<lb n="57"/>gueten frueünden unnd getrüwen
<lb n="58"/>lieben Eydtgnossen.
</p>
